  cache clear [<project_id>]                    Drop cached rows (whole DB or one project)
  help                                          Show this help
  version                                       Show version

Stories List Flags:
  --all                Fetch all pages (API returns 50 per page by default)
  --active             Loop server-side filter across ACTIVE_STATES — i.e. all
                       stories that are not accepted and not in the icebox
                       (unstarted, planned, started, finished, delivered,
                       rejected). Implies a full-paginated sweep per state.
  --state STATE        Server-side filter via ?filter=state:<state>.
                       Valid: unscheduled, unstarted, planned, started,
                       finished, delivered, rejected, accepted.
  --exclude-state S    Server-side filter via ?filter=-state:<state> (negation).
  --type TYPE          Filter by story_type. Server-side when no other state
