  --filter "<dsl>"     Raw single-clause Pivotal-style filter DSL passthrough
                       — overrides the friendlier flags above. See
                       'lt schema stories.list' for working clauses.
  --limit N            Page size (max 50; ignored when --all or --active)
  --offset N           Skip the first N stories (ignored when --all/--active)

Story Create Flags:
  --name "..."         Story name (required)
